sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Telemetry
  participant E as Edge node
  participant F as Flower
  participant Q as Qdrant
  participant T as Triage
  participant I as Investigator
  participant S as Security
  participant A as Dispatcher
  participant DB as SQLite
  D->>E: ingest local telemetry
  E->>E: score anomaly and create embedding
  E->>Q: store insight embedding
  E->>F: send model update
  F-->>E: aggregate global model
  E->>T: publish alert
  T->>Q: retrieve related evidence
  T->>I: escalate investigation
  I->>E: query node evidence
  I->>S: submit evidence package
  S->>Q: retrieve MITRE context
  S->>A: recommend remediation
  A->>DB: persist dispatch status
